### 1. Santé (attendu : 200, {"status":"ok"})
GET http://localhost:8000/health

### 2. Prévision scénario Tozeur (attendu : 200, 48 heures)
GET http://localhost:8000/forecast?lat=33.92&lon=8.13&crop=olive&areaM2=20000&panelAreaM2=24&panelEfficiency=0.18&days=2

### 3. Culture inconnue (attendu : 422)
GET http://localhost:8000/forecast?lat=33.92&lon=8.13&crop=mais&areaM2=20000&panelAreaM2=24

### 4. Anomalies démo (attendu : 200, 168 points dont 4 anomalies)
GET http://localhost:8000/anomalies/demo?days=7

### 5. Détection sur données fournies (attendu : 200, 6.9 et 1.1 en anomalie)
POST http://localhost:8000/anomalies/detect
Content-Type: application/json

{"points":[
  {"timestamp":"2026-07-10T08:00","powerKw":5.0},
  {"timestamp":"2026-07-10T09:00","powerKw":5.1},
  {"timestamp":"2026-07-10T10:00","powerKw":6.9},
  {"timestamp":"2026-07-10T11:00","powerKw":1.1},
  {"timestamp":"2026-07-10T12:00","powerKw":4.9}
]}
### 6. Démo : canicule + coupure forcée 14h-19h (attendu : outageRisk = 1.0 de 14h à 18h)
GET http://localhost:8000/forecast?lat=33.92&lon=8.13&crop=olive&areaM2=20000&panelAreaM2=24&scenario=canicule&forceOutageStart=14&forceOutageEnd=19

### 7. Heure de coupure invalide (attendu : 422)
GET http://localhost:8000/forecast?forceOutageStart=30